## LOG #9 - 2026-05-09 [COMPLETED]
### Action: Implemented Core Features from Implementation Plan

### Bug Fix:
1. ✅ auth.js
   - Removed duplicate function definitions (lines 113-186 were duplicates of lines 38-111)

### Features Implemented:

#### 1. CII Calculation with Stress Factors
- ✅ Implemented `calculateCII()` function using formula: CII = 100 - (Age_Factor + (Load * 1.5) + (Weather_Impact * 2.0))
- ✅ Added stress factor data to all components: loadGMT, rainfallIndex, thermalGradient
- ✅ CII scores now dynamically calculated on page load instead of hardcoded
- ✅ Component detail view shows stress factors and CII formula
- ✅ Component list shows Load and Rainfall data

#### 2. Offline Mode Toggle
- ✅ Added toggle switch in dashboard header
- ✅ Visual indicator: Online (green/white) vs Offline (red)
- ✅ AI analysis blocked in offline mode with error notification
- ✅ Sync to cloud blocked in offline mode
- ✅ Inspection submission shows "saved locally" message in offline mode
- ✅ Toggle persists across interactions

#### 3. AI Processing Simulation with Delays
- ✅ 7-step progressive status updates (600ms each, ~4.2s total)
- ✅ Steps: Uploading → Extracting features → Analyzing patterns → Comparing baseline → Calculating decay → Reasoning → Generating report
- ✅ Scan-line animation during processing
- ✅ Image shown at reduced opacity during analysis
- ✅ Random outcome: ~60% critical, ~40% nominal
- ✅ Critical override: Gemini can force CII < 30, overriding mathematical prediction
- ✅ Temporal Delta Analysis in results (Rate of Decay comparison)
- ✅ Certification report generation

#### 4. Truth Check (Human-in-the-Loop)
- ✅ "Disagree with AI" button appears after AI analysis
- ✅ Logs a "Calibration Event" when engineer disagrees
- ✅ Manual inspection takes precedence over AI
- ✅ Button hides after calibration event is logged
- ✅ Styled as danger action (red button) to indicate significance

### Files Updated:
1. ✅ auth.js - Bug fix (removed duplicates)
2. ✅ script.js - Complete rewrite with all new features
3. ✅ index.html - Added offline toggle and truth check HTML
4. ✅ styles.css - Added new styles for offline toggle, AI processing, truth check

### Key Changes Summary:
✅ CII = 100 - (Age_Factor + Load*1.5 + Weather*2.0) — dynamic calculation
✅ Offline toggle blocks AI + Sync features
✅ AI processing: 7-step progressive simulation with scan-line animation
✅ Gemini Critical Override: visual detection can force CII < 30
✅ Truth Check: engineer can disagree and log calibration event
✅ Pulse animation on critical component nodes
